      {
        "id": "UT8tGNIbe41eZmt0",
        "title": "One more tool: Ada Ideas",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>Do you have questions? You can ask your partner, your group, or your teacher. You can also ask Ada Ideas!</p><p>Ada is an AI. She seems like a person, but she&#x27;s really just another tool. She can help you really well with some things, but not with everything. It&#x27;s kind of like she&#x27;s still learning how to think. </p><p>Also, this is an engineering unit, meaning there isn&#x27;t just one way to do things. Ada can&#x27;t give you any answers or tell you if you&#x27;re right or wrong because there is not right or wrong: each program or prototype has advantages and disadvantages.</p><p>But she might have some ideas, or she might be able to help you with some things. You might want to give it a try!</p>"
          ]
        }
      },
